  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>A</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>B</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mi>C</mi><mo>(</mo><msub><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>)</mo></math> be complex numbers satisfying the equation <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and also satisfying the relation <math><mn>3</mn><msub><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math>. Then <math><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "1.75",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>C</mi></math> lie on the unit circle centered at the origin. Also,<br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msub><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1.0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>i.e. the line segment joining&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and origin<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>D</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;bisects the line segment joining&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi></math></p><p>Also,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>K</mi></math> and <math><mi>E</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>K</mi></math><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/c3acb540-bf0a-47b3-9753-0e7a2dc73c03.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:2.02014in;height:1.66042in\" /><br />Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math><br />From&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#9651;</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>,</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">BE</mtext><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>75</mn></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
